Subject: [PATCH] FEX: Preserve fault state and valid arithmetic immediates

Base-commit: 14c92681f4d62cf84d901460e0358de09c8847a7
Prerequisite: the preceding seventeen patches in Darwin/patches/series.

Keep committed fixed-register stores before potentially faulting consumers.
Build ADD/SUB through their arithmetic flag builders instead of deriving them
from a logical operation whose inline immediate domain differs. Invalidate
older generated code with Darwin cache namespace 0xA624.

